	(text "RADJ_AMP and LADJ_AMP are in a configuration that makes them\ninvert and scale. If volume is 0, their output is close to 2.2V.\nIf volume is 7 and all five channels are enabled, their output\ncan range from 4.1V (when all MIXER inputs are at 0.7V) to 0.3V\n(when all MIXER inputs are at 3.7V).\nLinearity may break down in edge cases when all five channels\nare enabled and all are at their lowest (0.7V) or all are at\ntheir highest (3.7V).\nMirror point of inversion is at 2.2V. If volume is 7 and only\nfour channels are enabled (no VIN), output ranges from 3.7V\n(when all enabled MIXER inputs are 0.7V) to 0.7V (when all\nenabled MIXER inputs are 3.7V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 242.57 232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "133d0b2d-27be-42f3-b302-d833c087acc3")
	)
